msgid "**Name**: ``iNaturalist_search_observations``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/inaturalist_tools.rst:102 b59635556f84456da3b787da91354dff
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for georeferenced species observations from "
"iNaturalist citizen scientists. Filter by taxon, location, date, and "
"quality grade. Returns observation details including species, location, "
"observer, date, and photo URLs. Useful for biodiversity surveys, species "
"distribution mapping, and ecological research. Example: research-grade "
"observations of bottlenose dolphins (taxon 41482) returns recent "
"sightings with GPS coordinates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/inaturalist_tools.rst:106 baf22215afd045d1bddc4032c8e74d40
msgid ""
"``taxon_id`` (integer, null) (optional) iNaturalist taxon ID to filter "
"by. Examples: 41482 (bottlenose dolphin), 41944 (tiger), 48662 (monarch "
"butterfly)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/inaturalist_tools.rst:109 b434fed58e124d9cb182e4259293d3ff
msgid ""
"``query`` (string, null) (optional) Text search for species name. "
"Alternative to taxon\\_id."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/inaturalist_tools.rst:112 3eed5b98cb4f4ff082361ca7fec9bc24
msgid ""
"``quality_grade`` (string, null) (optional) Observation quality: "
"'research' (community-verified), 'needs\\_id' (unverified), or 'casual'. "
"Default: 'research'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/inaturalist_tools.rst:115 1055f4f893334eb4ab29255ce2ed0d3a
msgid ""
"``place_id`` (integer, null) (optional) iNaturalist place ID to filter by"
" location. Example: 10211 (Yellowstone National Park)."
msgstr ""

