"**Description**: Search for species and taxa in the iNaturalist taxonomy."
" Returns matching organisms with their scientific and common names, "
"taxonomic rank, observation count, and conservation status. iNaturalist "
"aggregates citizen science biodiversity observations worldwide. Example: "
"searching 'Panthera tigris' returns the tiger with 22000+ observations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/inaturalist_tools.rst:148 15b265709b6d4f8aa1f6594a4e5ddc27
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query for taxon name (scientific or "
"common). Examples: 'Panthera tigris', 'monarch butterfly', 'redwood', "
"'Homo sapiens', 'blue whale'."
msgstr ""

